        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 801HE, Traditional Hawthorne Double Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Kwikset made Hawthorne Handleset is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this handleset is that the decorative grip will never go out of style; a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years. The simple handle features square mounts. This handleset is made out of solid brass construction. The double cylinder 801HE Door Entry Set is operated by key on both the inside and the outside. It is backed by a Kwikset lifetime mechanical and finish warranty.  Good for 1-3/4\" thick doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on both the inside and outside; and the latchbolt is operated by a turnknob inside and a thumbpiece outside. In order to increase security, double cylinder handlesets are usually used on front or back doors where there is a window in close proximity to the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/hawthorne-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800he\"><b>Hawthorne Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/hawthorne-dummy-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-802he\"><b>Hawthorne Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Hawthorne Double Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li> SmartKey cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 801HE Hawthorne Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 17-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 13-2/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt:  8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hawthorne Double Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 801HE",
                "description": "Kwikset 801HE Hawthorne Double Cylinder Handleset - This Kwikset made Hawthorne Handleset is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this handleset is that the decorative grip will never go out of style; a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years. The simple handle features square mounts. This handleset is made out of solid brass construction. The double cylinder 801HE Door Entry Set is operated by key on both the inside and the outside. It is backed by a Kwikset lifetime mechanical and finish warranty.  Good for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "KWI-801he, 801he double cylinder handlesets, 801he hawthorne handlesets, hawthorne handlesets, kwikset signature series, kwikset, handlesets, keyed handlesets, front door locks, deadbolt locksets, key locksets, double cylinder handlesets, 801he double cylinder handle sets, 801 he kwikset handlesets,  traditional handleseets, two piece handlesets,"
